# Smallbird Local — personal desktop build
#
# This app needs no build-time environment variables at all. Your AI
# provider API key (OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini) is entered at runtime through
# Settings -> API Keys and stored securely in Windows Credential Manager —
# never in a .env file, never in source, never committed.
#
# This file exists only as a placeholder in case future development adds a
# genuinely optional build-time setting. Copy it to .env for local reference
# if needed; it is never read by the app itself (Tauri/Rust here do not load
# .env files).
